# AX_LINEMODEL (experiment, tuning builds only; container AXLINE01, no format change of ACEPX2) - ace-core, 2026-10-02
# The FASTA line ends are taken out before LZ; the line model (headers + runs of equal line lengths; any other length is
# a run of its own) is stored zstd-19 in front of an ordinary ACEPX2 image of the sequence. Decode: every decoded block
# goes through a sink that puts its bytes and line ends in place while the block is in cache (tile path), else two passes.
# Every row: full decode median of 5 on 16 threads == input, 2000 random regions (1 B - 20 KB) == input.
# GRCh38 = UCSC hg38.fa.gz md5 1c9dcaddfa41027f17cd8f7a82c7293b, unpacked md5 b2aee9f885accc00531e59c4736bee63, 3 273 481 150 B.
